  "blocks": [
    {"id":"zk01_b01","section":"intro","original_segment_ids":["s04_setup"],"voiceover":"{{series}}里，{{A}}和{{B}}准备玩一轮{{gameLabel}}。"},
    {"id":"zk01_b02","section":"intro","original_segment_ids":["s01_hook"],"voiceover":"两位都想多拿分，为什么还得琢磨对方怎么选？"},
    {"id":"zk01_b03","section":"intro","original_segment_ids":["s02_four_questions"],"voiceover":"看懂这场博弈，我们先问四个问题。"},
    {"id":"zk01_b04","section":"players","original_segment_ids":["s03_question"],"voiceover":"第一，谁在做决定？"},
    {"id":"zk01_b05","section":"players","original_segment_ids":["s04_setup","s06_definition"],"voiceover":"{{A}}和{{B}}各自选牌，他们就是这场博弈的参与者。"},
    {"id":"zk01_b06","section":"players","original_segment_ids":["s05_goal","s06_definition"],"voiceover":"这一局，我们设定双方都希望自己的得分更高。"},
    {"id":"zk01_b07","section":"information","original_segment_ids":["s07_question"],"voiceover":"第二，做决定时，知道什么？"},
    {"id":"zk01_b08","section":"information","original_segment_ids":["s08_known_unknown","s10_distinction"],"voiceover":"双方都知道计分规则，但选牌时，看不到对方这一轮选了什么。"},
    {"id":"zk01_b09","section":"information","original_segment_ids":["s09_simultaneous"],"voiceover":"他们各自选好，再一起亮牌。"},
    {"id":"zk01_b10","section":"information","original_segment_ids":["s10_distinction","s11_timing"],"voiceover":"这叫同时行动：做决定时，不能先看见对方的选择，再决定自己出什么。"},
    {"id":"zk01_b11","section":"strategy","original_segment_ids":["s12_question"],"voiceover":"第三，能怎样选择？"},
    {"id":"zk01_b12","section":"strategy","original_segment_ids":["s13_options"],"voiceover":"这一轮，每位都可以选{{red}}牌，或者{{blue}}牌。"},
    {"id":"zk01_b13","section":"strategy","original_segment_ids":["s14_simple_case"],"voiceover":"这里只做一次决定，固定选{{red}}或固定选{{blue}}，就是两种纯策略。"},
    {"id":"zk01_b14","section":"strategy","original_segment_ids":["s15_definition"],"voiceover":"一般来说，策略是一整套应对计划：每种可能遇到的情况，都根据当时能知道的信息，安排好怎么选。","subtitle_chunks":[{"id":"zk01_b14_c01","spoken_span":"一般来说，策略是一整套应对计划：","suggested_lines":["一般来说，","策略是一整套应对计划："],"timing":null},{"id":"zk01_b14_c02","spoken_span":"每种可能遇到的情况，","suggested_lines":["每种可能遇到的情况，"],"timing":null},{"id":"zk01_b14_c03","spoken_span":"都根据当时能知道的信息，安排好怎么选。","suggested_lines":["都根据当时能知道的信息，","安排好怎么选。"],"timing":null}]},
    {"id":"zk01_b15","section":"strategy","original_segment_ids":["s16_comparison_intro"],"voiceover":"比如，假如改成多轮，每轮结束都能看到对方出的牌。"},
    {"id":"zk01_b16","section":"strategy","original_segment_ids":["s17_comparison_example"],"voiceover":"就可以先定好：第一轮选{{red}}；以后每一轮，跟着对方上一轮的牌选。"},
    {"id":"zk01_b17","section":"strategy","original_segment_ids":["s18_return_single_round"],"voiceover":"这是一个跨轮次的计划。现在回到本集，只玩一轮。"},
    {"id":"zk01_b18","section":"payoffs","original_segment_ids":["s19_question"],"voiceover":"第四，双方这样选，各会得到什么？"},
    {"id":"zk01_b19","section":"payoffs","original_segment_ids":["s20_definition"],"voiceover":"这一局，用得分表示收益。分数越高，对自己越好。","editorial_note":"支付是 payoff 的可用译法；本集移至术语备考，正文只用收益。"},
    {"id":"zk01_b20","section":"payoffs","original_segment_ids":["s21_rows","s22_columns"],"voiceover":"把四种选择组合放进表里，就得到了这张收益矩阵。"},
    {"id":"zk01_b21","section":"payoffs","original_segment_ids":["s21_rows"],"voiceover":"{{A}}选的牌，决定看哪一行。"},
    {"id":"zk01_b22","section":"payoffs","original_segment_ids":["s22_columns"],"voiceover":"{{B}}选的牌，决定看哪一列。"},
    {"id":"zk01_b23","section":"payoffs","original_segment_ids":["s23_score_order"],"voiceover":"每个格子里，先读{{A}}的分数，再读{{B}}的分数。"},
    {"id":"zk01_b24","section":"payoffs","original_segment_ids":["s24_rr_select"],"voiceover":"两位都选{{red}}牌。"},
    {"id":"zk01_b25","section":"payoffs","original_segment_ids":["s25_rr_score"],"voiceover":"{{joint.RR}}"},
    {"id":"zk01_b26","section":"payoffs","original_segment_ids":["s26_rb_select"],"voiceover":"{{A}}选{{red}}，{{B}}选{{blue}}。"},
    {"id":"zk01_b27","section":"payoffs","original_segment_ids":["s27_rb_score"],"voiceover":"{{A}}得{{score.RB.A}}分，{{B}}得{{score.RB.B}}分。"},
    {"id":"zk01_b28","section":"payoffs","original_segment_ids":["s28_br_select"],"voiceover":"{{A}}选{{blue}}，{{B}}选{{red}}。"},
    {"id":"zk01_b29","section":"payoffs","original_segment_ids":["s29_br_score"],"voiceover":"{{A}}得{{score.BR.A}}分，{{B}}得{{score.BR.B}}分。"},
    {"id":"zk01_b30","section":"payoffs","original_segment_ids":["s30_bb_select"],"voiceover":"两位都选{{blue}}牌。"},
    {"id":"zk01_b31","section":"payoffs","original_segment_ids":["s31_bb_score"],"voiceover":"{{joint.BB}}"},
    {"id":"zk01_b32","section":"payoffs","original_segment_ids":["s32_joint_choices"],"voiceover":"盯住{{A}}选{{red}}的这一行：对方选{{red}}，他得{{score.RR.A}}分；对方选{{blue}}，他得{{score.RB.A}}分。"},
    {"id":"zk01_b33","section":"payoffs","original_segment_ids":["s32_joint_choices"],"voiceover":"所以，收益取决于双方的选择组合。"},
    {"id":"zk01_b34","section":"payoffs","original_segment_ids":["s33_beyond_money"],"voiceover":"收益未必是钱，也可以表示省下的时间，或者对结果的偏好。"},
    {"id":"zk01_b35","section":"payoffs","original_segment_ids":["s33_beyond_money"],"voiceover":"具体怎么计，要看参与者在乎什么。"},
    {"id":"zk01_b36","section":"recap","original_segment_ids":["s34_intro"],"voiceover":"最后，记住这四问："},
    {"id":"zk01_b37","section":"recap","original_segment_ids":["s35_first_pair"],"voiceover":"谁来决定？知道什么？"},
    {"id":"zk01_b38","section":"recap","original_segment_ids":["s36_second_pair"],"voiceover":"怎么选择？各得什么？"},
    {"id":"zk01_b39","section":"recap","original_segment_ids":["s35_first_pair","s36_second_pair"],"voiceover":"对应的概念，就是参与者、信息、策略和收益。"},
    {"id":"zk01_b40","section":"recap","original_segment_ids":["s37_closing"],"voiceover":"先把这场博弈讲清楚，再分析他们会怎么选。"}
